&lt;article&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why Teneo in the Middle East?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our Management Consulting team advises senior leaders on the strategic questions that shape the future of their organisations. We combine rigorous analysis, commercial judgement and deep sector expertise to help clients solve complex business challenges and deliver meaningful outcomes across the Middle East.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The region is home to ambitious organisations, fast-changing markets and significant investment and transformation. As part of our growing Middle East team, you will work alongside experienced consultants on projects for leading corporates, public-sector organisations and investors, building your consulting skills while gaining exposure to a diverse range of sectors and business challenges.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Graduate Associate Consultant, you will quickly become involved in live client work. You will be given meaningful responsibility from the outset, with support from experienced colleagues, structured training and regular feedback as you develop your confidence and consulting toolkit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your work will include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;codex-docx-preview_listparagraph codex-docx-preview-num-1-0&quot;&gt;Conducting qualitative and quantitative research across companies, markets and sectors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;codex-docx-preview_listparagraph codex-docx-preview-num-1-0&quot;&gt;Analysing data and evidence to identify insights and support recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;codex-docx-preview_listparagraph codex-docx-preview-num-1-0&quot;&gt;Helping teams develop and test hypotheses and solve complex client problems&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;codex-docx-preview_listparagraph codex-docx-preview-num-1-0&quot;&gt;Producing clear, high-quality presentations and written materials for clients&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;codex-docx-preview_listparagraph codex-docx-preview-num-1-0&quot;&gt;Contributing ideas and perspectives to case team discussions and problem-solving&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;codex-docx-preview_listparagraph codex-docx-preview-num-1-0&quot;&gt;Working collaboratively with colleagues across Teneo and building an understanding of clients and markets across the Middle East&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will learn by doing, supported by a structured induction programme, ongoing training and coaching from experienced colleagues. Over time, you will build core skills in problem-solving, analysis, commercial judgement, communication and client service, while taking on increasing responsibility as your experience grows.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What we are looking for&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for curious, ambitious graduates with strong communication and problem-solving skills, a proactive attitude and a genuine interest in consulting and the Middle East. Our Graduate Associate Consultants can come from a wide variety of academic and personal backgrounds, and we value the different perspectives each person brings to the team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Demonstrating the following will place you in an excellent position for success:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;codex-docx-preview_listparagraph codex-docx-preview-num-1-0&quot;&gt;On track to achieve, or already hold, a Bachelor&#39;s degree in any discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;codex-docx-preview_listparagraph codex-docx-preview-num-1-0&quot;&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills, with a logical and structured approach&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;codex-docx-preview_listparagraph codex-docx-preview-num-1-0&quot;&gt;Confidence working with numbers and drawing conclusions from data&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;codex-docx-preview_listparagraph codex-docx-preview-num-1-0&quot;&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;codex-docx-preview_listparagraph codex-docx-preview-num-1-0&quot;&gt;Strong teamwork skills and the ability to work effectively with people from different backgrounds&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;codex-docx-preview_listparagraph codex-docx-preview-num-1-0&quot;&gt;Attention to detail and the ability to balance accuracy with productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;codex-docx-preview_listparagraph codex-docx-preview-num-1-0&quot;&gt;Drive to take on unfamiliar challenges and maximise learning and development opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Preferred&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;codex-docx-preview_listparagraph codex-docx-preview-num-1-0&quot;&gt;Fluency in Arabic&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Teneo&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Teneo is the global CEO advisory firm. We partner with our clients globally to do great things for a better future.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Drawing upon our global team and expansive network of senior advisors, we provide advisory services across our five business segments on a stand-alone or fully integrated basis to help our clients solve complex business challenges. Our clients include a significant number of the Fortune 100 and FTSE 100, as well as other cor­po­ra­tions, financial insti­tu­tions and organisations.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Our full range of advisory services includes strategic com­mu­ni­ca­tions, investor relations, financial trans­ac­tions and restruc­tur­ing, management consulting, physical and cyber risk, orga­ni­sa­tion­al design, board and executive search, geopolitics and government affairs, corporate governance and ESG.&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;The firm has more than 1,800 employees located in 50+ offices around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/article&gt;
&lt;footer&gt;&lt;/footer&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The Management Consulting Team at Teneo &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Our Management Consulting division advises senior leaders on strategic issues that define the success of their organisations. We combine rigorous analysis, commercial judgement and deep sector&amp;nbsp;expertise&amp;nbsp;with the broader capabilities of Teneo to help clients solve complex business challenges and deliver meaningful outcomes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We work across a diverse&amp;nbsp;range&amp;nbsp;of sectors,&amp;nbsp;including Consumer Goods, Healthcare, Leisure &amp;amp; Hospitality, Software, Transport&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;Telecom and Digital Infrastructure, amongst others. Within these markets, we provide strategic, operational, and due diligence support, advising FTSE 100 and Fortune 500&amp;nbsp;companies, key public-sector organisations, and leading private equity&amp;nbsp;investors.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
