&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As a&amp;nbsp;Director, you’ll be a key member of our senior team in Management Consulting&amp;nbsp;team. Your focus will be on delivering exceptional outcomes for clients,&amp;nbsp;while growing and developing our team.&amp;nbsp;Working closely with Senior&amp;nbsp;Managing Directors, you will&amp;nbsp;establish and nurture client relationships, contribute to business development activities, and support the continued growth of the practice. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;You will be an ambitious&amp;nbsp;and commercially minded leader with experience advising senior executives on complex business challenges. You will bring&amp;nbsp;a track record&amp;nbsp;of delivering high-impact engagements, building trusted relationships, and leading high-performing teams across a range of strategic,&amp;nbsp;operational&amp;nbsp;and organisational topics.&amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
